            "role": "N",
            "text": "1995年，《攻壳机动队》进入了人工智能与人文想象的历史。它提出了怎样的问题，又为什么值得我们今天重新回看？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "押井守的动画电影追问意识能否脱离肉身存在，并把身体、网络、自我身份与人工意识置于同一叙事框架。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-humanistic-1991-ghost-shell-record"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-humanistic-1991-ghost-shell-core"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个有吸引力的方向。真正让它成立的核心思想是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "作品或理论把人工制造、自动行动或计算过程转化为对主体性、理解与社会秩序的追问。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-humanistic-1991-ghost-shell-record"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-humanistic-1991-ghost-shell-core"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "研究者通常把这一节点视为 AI 人文史中的重要文化参照，而不是现代技术的直接预言。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-humanistic-1991-ghost-shell-record"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-humanistic-1991-ghost-shell-core"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "回看《意识的解释》，再看《攻壳机动队》，我们能听见同一个关于机器与人的问题跨越年代后的历史回响。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-humanistic-1991-ghost-shell-record"],
